Title: _**NIGHT SHIFT**_
Credit: Written by
Author: Sample Writer

INT. DINER - NIGHT #1#

Rain streaks the windows. MARA (30s, tired) wipes down the counter.

MARA
(under her breath)
Come on, close already.

The door chimes. DEX (40s) steps in, soaked.

DEX (O.S.)
Coffee. Black.

MARA
Kitchen's closed.

DEX
Then just the coffee.

CUT TO:

EXT. PARKING LOT - NIGHT #2#

Dex's truck idles. Headlights sweep across a dented sedan. A SHERIFF (50s) watches from a cruiser.

/* boneyard: cut this beat
DEX leans on the hood.
*/

= Synopsis lines are skipped

.FLASHBACK - MARA'S KITCHEN #3#

Sunlight. A younger MARA stirs a pot.

MARA
Taste this.

INT. DINER - BACK ROOM - NIGHT #3A#

Mara counts the till. SHERIFF knocks.

SHERIFF
Evening.

INT. DINER - LATER #4#

Dex is gone. A twenty sits under the cup.

MARA (CONT'D)
(to herself)
Of course.

FADE OUT.
